Apple's annual Back to School promotion is now live in the United Kingdom and 18 other European countries: <a href="https://www.apple.com/at-edu/shop/back-to-school">Austria</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/be-nl-edu/shop/back-to-school">Belgium</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/cz-edu/shop/back-to-school">Czechia</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/dk-edu/shop/back-to-school">Denmark</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/fi-edu/shop/back-to-school">Finland</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/fr-edu/shop/back-to-school">France</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/de-edu/shop/back-to-school">Germany</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/hu-edu/shop/back-to-school">Hungary</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/ie-edu/shop/back-to-school">Ireland</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/it-edu/shop/back-to-school">Italy</a>, the <a href="https://www.apple.com/nl-edu/shop/back-to-school">Netherlands</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/no-edu/shop/back-to-school">Norway</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/pl-edu/shop/back-to-school">Poland</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/pt-edu/shop/back-to-school">Portugal</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/es-edu/shop/back-to-school">Spain</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/se-edu/shop/back-to-school">Sweden</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/ch-de-edu/shop/back-to-school">Switzerland</a>, and <a href="https://www.apple.com/tr-edu/shop/back-to-school">Turkey</a>. <br/>
<br/>
